<h1 id="what-is-hashing">What is hashing?</h1>

<p>Hashing is an important data structure that used in computer science. It solves many problems easily. There are some advantages to use it. It basically has a <em>hash function</em> which is used for mapping data. It speeds up the inserting, deleting, or removing data from hash table. The hashing performance depends on hash function.</p>
